WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:07,440
In another half month, the chicks and ducks will hatch.

2
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,040
You have to build a home for them first

3
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:14,170
One hundred chickens, ducks and geese

4
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,170
Such a big place should be enough to live in

5
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:18,570
Today is the last day of the first year of the natural disaster

6
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:22,170
At this time in previous years, I could spend New Year’s Eve with my parents and friends.

7
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,170
I don’t know how everyone is doing now.

8
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:26,960
Shen Wan and Ding Wan, let’s get together

9
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,360
Aunt Zhou said she would cook for us

10
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,360
OK, come to my house. The living room is spacious.

11
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,960
I'm asking if Zhuang Yan is free.

12
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,930
Probably on another mission

13
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,330
Please contact me later

14
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:38,870
Everyone knows that Moh's supplies are tight.

15
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,470
The ingredients should be a bit low-key

16
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,270
Don't bring out anything too eye-catching

17
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:45,920
And bean sprouts

18
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,720
Aunt Zhou is very powerful herself, right?

19
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,720
Salty and salty

20
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,720
I just happened to fry some bacon, bean sprouts and half a kelp today.

21
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,720
It’s a good meal tonight
